{"t":"SOLV","n":"Solventum Corporation","nKo":"솔벤텀","ex":"NYSE","cur":"USD","px":85.4,"chg":0.9,"chgPct":0.01065,"prev":84.5,"dayH":86.24,"dayL":84.34,"w52H":94.16,"w52L":62.38,"vol":1006724,"avgVol":912580,"mcap":14514319360,"pe":95.96,"fpe":11.32,"eps":0.89,"feps":7.54,"pb":3.02,"div":null,"divY":0.0,"beta":0.75,"short":5047939,"shortPct":0.035,"shortRatio":4.77,"prof":{"c":"United States","cKo":"미국","s":"Healthcare","sKo":"헬스케어","i":"Medical Instruments & Supplies","iKo":"의료 기기 및 용품","city":"Eagan","emp":20584,"web":"https://www.solventum.com","sum":"Solventum Corporation, a healthcare company, develops, manufactures, and commercializes a portfolio of solutions to address critical customer and patient needs in the United States and internationally. It operates through three segments: Medsurg, Dental Solutions, and Health Information Systems. The Medsurg segment offers solutions, such as negative pressure wound therapy, advanced wound dressings, advanced skin care, synthetic tissue matrices, I.V. site management, sterilization assurance, temperature management, surgical supplies, medical tapes and wraps, stethoscopes, medical electrodes, and medical technologies for original equipment manufacturers. The Dental Solutions segment provides dental and orthodontic products, including brackets, aligners, restorative cements, and bonding agent","sumKo":"의료 회사인 Solventum Corporation은 미국 및 전 세계의 중요한 고객 및 환자 요구 사항을 해결하기 위한 솔루션 포트폴리오를 개발, 제조 및 상용화합니다. Medsurg, Dental Solutions 및 Health Information Systems의 세 가지 부문을 통해 운영됩니다. Medsurg 부문은 음압 상처 치료, 고급 상처 드레싱, 고급 피부 관리, 합성 조직 매트릭스, I.V. 현장 관리, 멸균 보증, 온도 관리, 수술 용품, 의료용 테이프 및 랩, 청진기, 의료 전극 및 OEM을 위한 의료 기술. 치과 솔루션 부문은 브래킷, 얼라이너, 수복용 시멘트 및 결합제를 포함한 치과 및 교정 제품을 제공합니다."},"fin":{"annual":[{"y":2023,"rev":0,"ni":1346000000},{"y":2024,"rev":8254000000,"ni":479000000},{"y":2025,"rev":8325000000,"ni":1556000000}],"quarterly":[{"q":"4Q2025","rev":1998000000,"ni":63000000},{"q":"1Q2026","rev":2007000000,"ni":13000000},{"q":"2Q2026","rev":22